  m_text: "Your body fights on the left. Your mind answers on the right.\n\n<b>A</b>
    / <b>D</b>   move        <b>W</b>   jump\n<b>S</b>   fast fall, or drop through
    a platform\n<b>Space</b>   punch  (costs one action point)\n\nAnswer a question
    correctly to earn an action point.\nAnswer it <b>while the timer bar is still
    green</b> to earn Flow.\nFill the Flow meter and your punches hit twice as hard
    \u2014 but every swing spends it, so make the window count."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f962865d8fe8bd542aa2c02b4a108f3c, type: 2}
